you're dying anymore. I guess.

202
00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:08.106
Yeah. sure. I'll do that.

203
00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:10.090
No. I'm not gonna do that. You do that.

204
00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.146
